<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIA TAKE 2-0 LEAD IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIA TAKE 2-0 LEAD IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia led the Czech Republic 2-0 in their Davis Cup quarter-final tie after the opening round of singles on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Pat Rafter beat Martin Damm 6-1 7-6 (9-7) 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>Mark Philippoussis beat David Rikl 6-1 6-4 2-6 6-4</p>
